.el .ds Aq '
.TH rpmcrab 1  "rpmcrab 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
rpmcrab \- Check for common problems in rpm packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrpmcrab\fR [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-e\fR|\fB\-\-explain\fR] [\fB\-r\fR|\fB\-\-rpmlintrc\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-print\-config\fR] [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-installed\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-time\-report\fR] [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-jobs\fR] [\fB\-\-ignore\-unused\-rpmlintrc\fR] [\fB\-\-checks\fR] [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-permissive\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-mini\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIrpmfile\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check for common problems in rpm packages
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version and exit
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<path>\fR
Config file or directory of `*.toml` (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-explain\fR \fI<id>...\fR
Print the description for a message id and exit
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-rpmlintrc\fR \fI<path>\fR
A rpmlintrc file (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Inline explanations (and re\-raise internal errors)
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-print\-config\fR
Dump the merged configuration as TOML and exit
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-installed\fR \fI<name>...\fR
Check installed RPM DB packages
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-time\-report\fR
Per\-check timing report
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-jobs\fR \fI<n>\fR [default: 10]
Number of parallel worker threads for checking packages (1 for sequential)
.TP
\fB\-\-ignore\-unused\-rpmlintrc\fR
Suppress the `unused\-rpmlintrc\-filter` audit
.TP
\fB\-\-checks\fR \fI<a,b,c>\fR
Run only these checks (debug)
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-strict\fR
Treat all messages as errors
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-permissive\fR
Treat individual errors as non\-fatal
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-mini\-mode\fR
Called from the rpmlint\-mini wrapper (SUSE\-only)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIrpmfile\fR]
RPMs / specfiles / directories to check
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
